WEBVTT

00:01:28.632 --> 00:01:30.934
the UN Secretary General
mentioned an initiative

00:01:30.958 --> 00:01:33.299
called the Race to Zero.

00:01:33.323 --> 00:01:35.251
I want to come back to that for a moment

00:01:35.275 --> 00:01:38.045
because it's the crucial race for humanity

00:01:38.069 --> 00:01:41.093
and it requires governments,
cities, businesses

00:01:41.117 --> 00:01:43.426
and all of us to work together.

00:01:43.895 --> 00:01:45.045
To tell us more

00:01:45.069 --> 00:01:47.692
I want to bring in the United Kingdom
Secretary of State

00:01:47.716 --> 00:01:51.516
for business, energy
and industrial strategy, Alok Sharma,

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:53.674
who's also a president
of the United Nation's

00:01:53.698 --> 00:01:55.889
climate conference COP26

00:01:55.913 --> 00:01:58.713
which will take place
in Glasgow next year.

00:01:59.386 --> 00:02:03.358
[Alok Sharma]